/T (The project "Implement Client Script & UI Policy \(Incident\)" focuses on enforcing data integrity and conditional field behaviors directly at the user interface level within ServiceNow Incident Management. By utilizing built-in UI Policies and custom client-side scripts, the system dynamically governs form interactions, mandatory field rules, and validation checks.)
